    affiliation: The Synexis Project
keywords:
  - earthquake forecasting
  - CSEP
  - pre-registration
  - magnitude of completeness
  - Gutenberg-Richter
  - JMA
  - Japan
  - information gain
  - pseudo-prospective evaluation
  - reproducibility
